/*
  VehicleCharts.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0303 · VehicleCharts (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `VehicleCharts` resolves (table "VehicleCharts") lives here with its web value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface
  prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Group 1 is the exact keys + values extracted from the web source
  (features/vehicles/components/VehicleCharts.tsx). Group 2 localizes the labels +
  value tokens the web hardcoded in English (the native covenant forbids literals
  in code). Group 3 backs the native-only chrome (map, chart, loading / error /
  empty, freshness).
*/

